      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "BREAKING: Dominican Republic Government advances plans to expand Starlink connectivity and explores Grok for education. 🇩🇴\n\nPresident Luis Abinader met with SpaceX executives and the Instituto Tecnológico de las Américas (ITLA) to discuss the initiatives:\n\n• More than 50,000 Starlink antennas are already installed across the country.\n\n• Starlink is already benefiting 1,608 students at ITLA’s Pedernales and Cotuí campuses.\n\n• Further expansion would bring internet to communities and schools where traditional services are limited or unavailable.\n\n• Grok Tutor is being considered for personalized learning support, helping students develop reasoning and critical thinking with teacher supervision.\n\n• Its potential integration would support RD Inteligente, a Government program aiming to train one million Dominicans in AI.",
      "quote": null,
